[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9060.23, "timestamp": "02:31:00", "text": "呃，自从每 6 小时运行一次以来，它一直"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9062.95, "timestamp": "02:31:02", "text": "运行得"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9078.23, "timestamp": "02:31:18", "text": "当你花费几个小时构建一些东西，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9081.59, "timestamp": "02:31:21", "text": "并在几分钟后看到它时，感觉真好。 几个星期甚至更久"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9086.95, "timestamp": "02:31:26", "text": "之后，你都没去看它，或者"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9089.27, "timestamp": "02:31:29", "text": "说，你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9094.95, "timestamp": "02:31:34", "text": "用了一段时间没用它之后，再回来看，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9097.67, "timestamp": "02:31:37", "text": "发现它还在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9101.349, "timestamp": "02:31:41", "text": "尽力运行。它还在运行。它还"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9103.59, "timestamp": "02:31:43", "text": "活着。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9106.15, "timestamp": "02:31:46", "text": "这让你有点高兴，因为，是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9112.87, "timestamp": "02:31:52", "text": "虽然从效率的角度来看，它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9115.59, "timestamp": "02:31:55", "text": "无关紧要，但它确实"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9119.11, "timestamp": "02:31:59", "text": "奏效了一段时间。是的，我"}]